      "cooked": "<p>Hey had a question on the mr. chomps plushie. My wife gave birth to our son a week and a half ago and I saw the mr. chomps plushie. As a fan of sentinels this would be awesome for him. As a new father who has no clue what he is doing, I have to worry on how big this is and how safe it is for him? So any help on this front from the GTG staff or people who have one would be great.</p>",
